#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:1
msgid "Shanghai Technology Innovation Center"
msgstr "上海市科技创业中心"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:4
msgid "上海市科技创业中心"
msgstr "上海市科技创业中心"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:6
msgid "Research platform | Xuhui | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "科研平台｜徐汇区｜资料核查日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Software AI, Hardware AI, Industry."
msgstr "AI及产业方向：AI软件、AI硬件、产业。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:10
msgid ""
"The municipal science-and-technology entrepreneurship service institution "
"coordinating Shanghai's high-quality incubator cultivation system, "
"innovation vouchers, technology SME filings and the Startup in Shanghai "
"portal."
msgstr "市级科技创业服务机构，负责上海高质量孵化器培育、科技创新券、科技型中小企业服务，以及“上海科创在线／创·在上海”等平台相关工作。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:12
msgid "`Evidence S059 <https://shtic.com/>`_. 上海市科技创业中心."
msgstr "`资料来源 S059 <https://shtic.com/>`_. 上海市科技创业中心."

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:14
msgid ""
"`Evidence S060 "
"<https://stcsm.sh.gov.cn/zwgk/tzgs/gsgg/zhgsgg/20250721/5376ca63676c438dac68a2f1b6313366.html>`_. "
"关于公布纳入2025年上海市科技创新创业载体培育体系载体的通知_业务公示公告_上海市科学技术委员会."
msgstr "`资料来源 S060 <https://stcsm.sh.gov.cn/zwgk/tzgs/gsgg/zhgsgg/20250721/5376ca63676c438dac68a2f1b6313366.html>`_. 关于公布纳入2025年上海市科技创新创业载体培育体系载体的通知_业务公示公告_上海市科学技术委员会."

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:16
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "项目状态与支持内容"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:19
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:21
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "尚未确认统一的现金资助额度、费用减免或股权比例，请向运营机构索取最新书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:23
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系方式与地址"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:26
msgid "`Official website / intake route <https://shtic.com/>`_"
msgstr "`官网及申请渠道 <https://shtic.com/>`_"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:28
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网咨询具体负责部门及最新申请方式。本图谱不公开电子邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:30
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图采用行政区或校区参考点，不代表已核实的办公地址。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:32
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:35
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:37
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读有明确发布日期的通知，确认属地、申请主体、业务及费用发生期间等条件。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:39
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "按清单准备材料，并按要求取得依托单位或区级部门推荐。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:41
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止时间前通过官方平台提交，保存受理回执。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:43
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "按通知要求完成评审、立项、报告、验收及资金拨付手续。"

#: ../../entities/shtic.rst:45
msgid ":doc:`Xuhui district route </districts/xuhui>`"
msgstr ":doc:`徐汇区合作指南 </districts/xuhui>`"

